  description:
  - Majority of the honey produced in these hives consists of 90% liquified ash,
    with as little as 5% being actual plant nectar. This composition serves two purposes.
    This mixture perfectly suits the dietary needs of the PyreFly, while also being
    unappealing to alternative species, leaving the Pyrefly species with currently
    no known predators.
